              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu dituku adi Mukelenge neolole tshianza tshiandi tshiakabidi bua kuhikuleye difuka dia bantu bandi badi mu Ashû, mu Ejipitu, mu Patelosa, mu Atiopa, mu Elama, mu Shinâ, mu Hamata ne mu maloba adi ku muelelu wa mai manene.",
          "type": "text",
